OL,3,GNEWSAJogger's fear after van follows
OL,4,Aher on remote road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has said she "feared for her
OL,7,Flife" after being followed by a van
OL,8,Fwhile out jogging on a secluded road
OL,9,Fnear Deal.
OL,11,FKelly Crowd said she was left "shaken"
OL,12,Fby the incident at Betteshanger and
OL,13,Freported it to police.
OL,15,FThe route had been one of her favourite
OL,16,Fplaces to run after work, but she said
OL,17,Fthe experience made her reluctant to
OL,18,Fexercise there alone.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
